{"id":"923ca3856ded4fd3","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-fourier-series.md","title":"Fourier Series","display":"df-fourier-series — Fourier Series","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fourier-series","aliases":["58-df-fourier-series"],"display":"df-fourier-series — Fourier Series","depends_on":["[[58-df-lp-space]]","[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fourier-series"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fourier-series</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fourier-series — Fourier Series"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (Lebesgue 测度谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(L^2(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (带载体、sigma-代数与测度的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> 空间, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FourierSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FourierSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (本文件定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> Fourier 展开关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fourier\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{FourierSeries}_S(f,c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\exists I,\\mathcal L,\\lambda,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\land I=[0,2\\pi]\\land\\mathcal L_I=\\{A\\cap I:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\\land\\lambda_I=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_I\\land f\\in L^2(I,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(c(n)=\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_I f(t)e^{-int}\\,d\\lambda_I(t)\\right)\\land\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\int_I\\left|f(t)-\\sum_{n=-N}^{N}c(n)e^{int}\\right|^2d\\lambda_I(t)=0\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fourier\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{FourierSeries}_S(f,c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\exists I,\\mathcal L,\\lambda,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\land I=[0,2\\pi]\\land\\mathcal L_I=\\{A\\cap I:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\\land\\lambda_I=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_I\\land f\\in L^2(I,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(c(n)=\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_I f(t)e^{-int}\\,d\\lambda_I(t)\\right)\\land\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\int_I\\left|f(t)-\\sum_{n=-N}^{N}c(n)e^{int}\\right|^2d\\lambda_I(t)=0\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fourier series expand functions on the circle in exponential modes；本原子采用区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,2\\pi]\">\\(I=[0,2\\pi]\\)</span> 上的限制 Lebesgue 测度及其可测集，并明确要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2(I,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I)\">\\(L^2(I,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I)\\)</span> 收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lp-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (Lebesgue 测度谓词, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L^2(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)$ (带载体、sigma-代数与测度的 $L^2$ 空间, see [[58-df-lp-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"L^2(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"L^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FourierSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"L^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fourier\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{FourierSeries}_S(f,c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\exists I,\\mathcal L,\\lambda,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\land I=[0,2\\pi]\\land\\mathcal L_I=\\{A\\cap I:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\\land\\lambda_I=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_I\\land f\\in L^2(I,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(c(n)=\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_I f(t)e^{-int}\\,d\\lambda_I(t)\\right)\\land\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\int_I\\left|f(t)-\\sum_{n=-N}^{N}c(n)e^{int}\\right|^2d\\lambda_I(t)=0\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"I=[0,2\\pi]","display":false},{"tex":"L^2(I,\\mathcal L_I,\\lambda_I)","display":false}],"bytes":1472,"backlinks":[{"id":"ec822da63d54930d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-545","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-fourier-series.md|58-df-fourier-series]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a1d034d5d39b4a14","68427bc628af9b8d"]}